docs: in-repo localization EN/RU/ZH + wiki links everywhere

- README.ru.md / README.zh.md: full mirrors with per-language wiki URLs
- configs/*: localized .ru/.zh copies (comments translated; variables and
  values byte-identical, like recipes tp4.env.example convention)
- tests/unit/test_config_locales.py: locale parity + no-credentials tests
- docs/*: banner on every page linking to the multilingual wiki
